 told:\n\n- The **second scene has six more lines** than the song.\n- The song has 54 lines, so the second scene has:\n\n$$\n54 + 6 = 60 \\text{ lines}\n$$\n\n- **Four-fifths of them are his lines**, so:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5} \\times 60 = 48 \\text{ lines}\n$$\n\nSo, Sean has to memorize **48 lines** from the second scene.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Total Lines to Memorize**\n\nNow, we add up all the lines Sean has to memorize:\n\n- Solo song: 54 lines  \n- First scene: 36 lines  \n- Second scene: 48 lines  \n\nTotal:\n\n$$\n54 + 36 + 48 = \\boxed{138} \\text{ lines}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{138}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 10.279474621638656, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 119, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "6341f8dd87d808cb3c07f1ac881e9bebb326d07f1290f8666c19aa111b0c4296", "output_tokens": 391, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20531735552, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20891828224, "problem_id": "gsm8k/a9798075c6e641a8", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 10313.934909179807}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "138", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 10.313934909179807, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20891828224, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20891828224, "sampling_seed": 2460951069785023256, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 391, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.033001757226884365, "turn_index": 0}
